w: 1.~Good Christ- ian men, re- joice, _ _ With heart, and soul, and voice; _ _ Give ye heed to what we say: Je- sus Christ is born to- day; Earth and heav'n be- fore him bow, And he is in the man- ger now. Christ is born to- day! _ Christ is born to- day!
w: 2.~Good Christ- ian men, re- joice, _ _ With heart, and soul, and voice; _ _ Now ye hear of end- less bliss: Je- sus Christ was born for this! He hath op'ed the heaven- ly door, And man is bless- ed ev- er- more. Christ was born for this! _ Christ was born for this!
w: 3.~Good Christ- ian men, re- joice, _ _ With heart, and soul, and voice; _ _ Now ye need not fear the grave: Je- sus Christ was born to save! Calls you one and calls you all To gain his ev- er- last- ing hall. Christ was born to save! _ Christ was born to save!
